## 4. Security and redaction rules (non-negotiable)

- No secrets in repo, ever.
- Env-var only authentication.
- Do not record device identifiers by default in repo-committed artifacts.
- If a domain has a Top Secret UI boundary, document the boundary and what is allowed behind it.

